    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d247">

                <pb facs="0393" n="305" sameAs="frus:frus1892/pg305"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Herbert to Mr. Foster.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >British Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Newport, R.
                                I.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1892-09-01"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">September 1,
                    1892</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With reference to my note of the 23d July
                    last, in regard to the construction to be given to the Canadian wrecking act of
                    May 10th, 1892, I have the honor, in accordance with a request which I have
                    received from the Governor General of Canada, to transmit a copy of an order in
                    council, embodying the views of the Canadian minister of justice upon the
                    subject in question.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Michael H.
                    Herbert.</hi></signed></closer>



